services='''<section class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION</p><h1>Improve the work.<br>Connect the <em>pieces.</em></h1><p>Start with the customer or team problem. Use the website, workflow, and tools to solve it.</p></section><section class="section shell service-detail" id="websites"><span class="row-index">01</span><div><p class="eyebrow">WEBSITES & CUSTOMER JOURNEYS</p><h2>A better first handoff.</h2><p>Service websites that explain the offer and connect visitors to an inquiry, appointment, or appropriate purchase. Public pages stay easy to use; protected customer work gets a separate access boundary.</p><a class="button primary" href="/website-lift.html">Explore website design <span>→</span></a></div></section><section class="section shell service-detail" id="operations"><span class="row-index">02</span><div><p class="eyebrow">CONNECTED OPERATIONS</p><h2>Find the repeated work<br>and fragile handoffs.</h2><p>Map intake, scheduling, assignment, reporting, and follow-up. Establish the system of record, the responsible people, and the improvement worth building first.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/questionnaire.html">Start an operational assessment <span>→</span></a></div></section><section class="section shell service-detail" id="microsoft"><span class="row-index">03</span><div><p class="eyebrow">MICROSOFT 365 · DATA · AUTOMATION · AI</p><h2>Make the tools serve<br>the way you work.</h2><p>Microsoft 365 modernization, Power Apps, Power Automate, Power BI, and practical AI adoption. The solution follows the requirements and ownership plan.</p><a class="button secondary" href="'''+BOOK+'''">Book a conversation <span>→</span></a></div></section><section class="section surface"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">THE RDC ENGAGEMENT LADDER</p><h2>Buy the work you need.<br>Deliver it in clear phases.</h2><div class="rung-list">'''+''.join(f'<article><span>RUNG {i+1}</span><h3>{n}</h3><strong>{v}</strong><p>{d}</p></article>' for i,(n,v,d) in enumerate(rungs))+'''</div><p class="fine-print">Service rungs define commercial scope. The six delivery phases define how we deliver it. Project ranges depend on a written scope; complex migrations, extra users, custom integrations, and additional workflows are estimated separately.</p></div></section>'''+cta()
