about='''<section class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">ROYAL DIGITAL CLARITY</p><h1>People first.<br>Practical by <em>design.</em></h1><p>Digital improvement should make the next task easier to understand, complete, and own.</p></section><section class="section shell about-strip"><img src="/assets/dakota-king.jpg" alt="Dakota King, founder of Royal Digital Clarity" width="330" height="390"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR RDC CONTACT</p><h2>Work directly<br>with Dakota King.</h2><p>My work centers on digital transformation and process improvement. RDC brings that experience to small businesses that need clearer websites, better-connected tools, and fewer dropped handoffs.</p><p>We start by understanding how the business works today. Then we agree the outcome, build in manageable steps, and make the operating responsibilities clear.</p><a class="button primary" href="mailto:dakota@royaldigitalclarity.com">Talk to Dakota <span>→</span></a></div></section><section class="section surface"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">BASED IN OLALLA, WASHINGTON</p><h2>Clear strategy.<br>Practical execution.<br>Measurable results.</h2></div><div><p>We work around the real needs of the business: customers, people, processes, information, and ownership.</p><p>We use truthful content, minimal data, and proportionate security. We measure the useful business outcome and explain what was actually verified.</p><a class="text-link" href="/workflow.html">See how we deliver →</a></div></div></section>'''+cta()
(ROOT/'about.html').write_text(page('About Dakota and Royal Digital Clarity','Work directly with Dakota King on practical websites, processes, and digital transformation for small businesses.',about,'about'))

privacy='''<section class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">TEST WEBSITE PRIVACY</p><h1>A clear view of<br>your <em>information.</em></h1><p>This notice describes this redesign test site and its browser-only workspace preview.</p></section><section class="prose shell"><h2>Website questionnaire</h2><p>The questionnaire prepares a summary in your current browser tab. Answers are not automatically uploaded or saved to local storage. Refreshing or closing the page clears them. Downloading saves a file to your device; copying uses your clipboard. Opening an email draft does not send it: you must choose Send in your email app.</p><h2>Workspace preview</h2><p>The workspace uses sample project data. Actions and choices change this tab only. Exporting a review downloads a file to your device. There is no connection to live customer records, payment services, or portal sign-in in this preview.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>If you follow a booking or email link, that service handles the information you provide under its own terms and privacy practices. Contact RDC if you need help choosing a way to share information.</p><h2>Hosting and contact</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical request information to operate and protect the site. This test release adds no analytics or advertising scripts. If you send an email, RDC receives the information you choose to include for responding and discussing the work. Ask Dakota about access, correction, or deletion of information you have sent.</p><h2>Share only what is needed</h2><p>Do not enter passwords, card details, sensitive documents, or private customer records. Uploads and protected customer work require a separately agreed secure process.</p><p>Questions: <a href="mailto:dakota@royaldigitalclarity.com">dakota@royaldigitalclarity.com</a>.</p><p class="fine-print">Test release notice · November 8, 2026. Production practices and policies must be reviewed before this redesign is published live.</p></section>'''
(ROOT/'privacy.html').write_text(page('Privacy for the RDC test website','How the RDC test questionnaire and sample workspace handle information, downloads, email drafts, and external booking links.',privacy,'privacy'))
(ROOT/'404.html').write_text(page('Page not found','The requested RDC test page could not be found.','<section class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">404 · PAGE NOT FOUND</p><h1>Let’s find a<br>clearer <em>path.</em></h1><p>This page is unavailable. Return to RDC or start a website brief.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/">Back to RDC →</a><a class="button secondary" href="/website-intake.html">Website brief →</a></div></section>','404'))

questions=[('business','Tell us about your business','Business name, what you do, and where you serve customers. Local, remote, or both?',True),('audience','Who should the website attract?','Your ideal customer, what they need help with, and the 1–3 services to feature.',True),('action','What should visitors do next?','Choose a main action: request a quote, book, call, message, buy, or other. Who receives requests, and what happens next?',True),('essentials','What must the first demo get right?','Up to three essentials: service details, prices or quote process, common questions, or examples of your work.',True),('style','What should it look and feel like?','Your logo, colors, approved photos, or 1–2 websites you like. No assets yet? Describe the style.',False),('existing','What do you already use?','Your current site and any email, calendar, booking, customer/job management, or payment tools to keep.',False),('timing','What are your timing and budget expectations?','Target date. Optional: setup budget and comfortable monthly cost. “Not sure” is welcome.',False),('privacy','Any special features or private details?','Mention payments, customer sign-in, private documents, sensitive information, or anything to keep off the site. Share no private records.',False)]
form='''<section class="intake-intro shell"><a class="text-link" href="/website-lift.html">← Website design</a><p class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST WEBSITE DEMO · ABOUT 5–10 MINUTES</p><h1>A few answers.<br>A clearer <em>starting point.</em></h1><p>Short replies are enough. “Not sure” is useful too. Your answers stay in this page until you copy, download, or send them yourself.</p></section><section class="intake-layout shell"><form id="demo-brief" class="brief-form"><div class="form-contact"><div><label for="contact-name">Your name <span>Required</span></label><input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="200"></div><div><label for="contact-email">Email <span>Required</span></label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="320"></div></div>'''+''.join(f'<div class="brief-question"><span class="question-number">0{i+1}</span><div><label for="q-{k}">{t} <span>{"Required" if req else "Optional"}</span></label><p id="hint-{k}">{hint}</p><textarea id="q-{k}" name="{k}" rows="3" maxlength="2400" aria-describedby="hint-{k}" {"required" if req else ""}></textarea></div></div>' for i,(k,t,hint,req) in enumerate(questions))+'''<div class="form-end"><p>No passwords, card details, or private customer records. Nothing is uploaded. Refreshing this page clears your answers.</p><button class="button primary" type="submit">Review my demo brief <span>→</span></button></div></form><aside class="brief-aside"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT HAPPENS NEXT</span><h2>Direction first.<br>Then a demo.</h2><ol><li>Tell us the essentials.</li><li>Review and send your brief.</li><li>We clarify any important gaps.</li><li>Use the demo to agree direction.</li></ol><p>Scope, costs, and publication are agreed separately.</p><a class="text-link" href="/downloads/RDC-Website-Demo-Questionnaire.docx">Prefer Word? Download the questionnaire ↓</a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:dakota@royaldigitalclarity.com">Ask Dakota a question →</a></aside><section id="brief-result" class="brief-result" hidden tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">READY FOR YOUR REVIEW</p><h2>Your website demo brief.</h2><p id="brief-status" role="status">This brief is on your screen. It has not been sent to RDC.</p><pre id="brief-output"></pre><div class="actions"><button class="button primary" id="download-brief" type="button">Download brief ↓</button><button class="button secondary" id="copy-brief" type="button">Copy brief</button><a class="button secondary" id="email-brief" href="mailto:dakota@royaldigitalclarity.com">Open email draft →</a><button class="text-button" id="edit-brief" type="button">Edit answers</button></div><p class="fine-print">You must press Send in your email app. For a long brief, download and attach the file so your app does not cut it short. Closing or refreshing clears this page.</p></section></section>'''
(ROOT/'website-intake.html').write_text(page('Website demo questionnaire','Eight short questions for a useful first website demo. Prepare a brief in your browser, review it, and choose how to send it to RDC.',form,'website-intake',extra='<script src="/demo-brief.js" defer></script>'))
(ROOT/'demo-questions.json').write_text(json.dumps([dict(id=k,title=t,hint=h,required=r) for k,t,h,r in questions],indent=2))
